/*
# SalaamCircle — Seed Reference Data

## What this migration does
Populates the database with initial reference/sample content so the app is
fully functional on first launch. All inserts use ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING so
re-running is safe.

## Data seeded
1. Communities (11) — the default category-based community groups
2. Mosques (12) — major UK mosques as verified directory entries
3. News (6) — published news articles with Pexels stock images
4. Jobs (5) — sample job listings (all approved)
5. Events (5) — sample upcoming events (all approved)
6. News articles (3) — pending items in the admin moderation queue

## Important notes
- Community slugs are auto-generated by the trg_generate_community_slug trigger
  during INSERT, so they're not specified manually here.
- Job posted_by is left NULL (no user account exists yet at seed time).
- Event creator_id is left NULL for the same reason.
- All image URLs use Pexels stock photos (per project convention).
*/

-- ============================================================
-- 1. COMMUNITIES (11 default categories)
-- ============================================================
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- ============================================================
-- 2. MOSQUES (12 major UK mosques)
-- ============================================================
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- ============================================================
-- 3. NEWS (6 published articles)
-- ============================================================
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- ============================================================
-- 4. JOBS (5 sample listings, all approved)
-- ============================================================
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- ============================================================
-- 5. EVENTS (5 sample upcoming events, all approved)
-- ============================================================
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- ============================================================
-- 6. NEWS ARTICLES (3 pending in admin moderation queue)
-- ============================================================
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
